   "text": "Being immersed in the tech world is a privilege; our team gets to travel to product announcements, trade shows, developer conferences, and small gatherings to bring our readers up close and personal with the latest technology innovations.\nAndroid Police attends dozens of live events every year where we meet with industry peers and company executives. Below are a few examples of those events and so",
