   "textLength": 5777,
   "text": "August 2026\nMade by Google 2026\nWhile there weren't many surprises, Google's latest lineup is solid, with thoughtful hardware updates and a ton of new AI features, courtesy of Google Gemini. The Pixel 11, Pixel 11 Pro, Pixel 11 Pro XL, and Pixel 11 Pro Fold were officially announced and joined by a new Pixel Watch 5, the Pixel Buds Pro 2, and the long-rumored Pixel Tag.\nRead our coverage\nJuly 2026",
