   "text": "January 2025\nCES 2025\nTwo members of the Android Police team attended CES 2025, which is the world’s biggest consumer electronics show. The yearly event is hosted in Las Vegas and it’s our first opportunity of the year to see new gadgets. Google Editor, Taylor Kerns, and Phones Editor, Will Sattelberg, went to the show to try out new smartphones, TVs, tablets, wearables, headphones and a selection",
